</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">e</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Event passed to the AO’s HSM initial state. NULL if not used. If NULL is provided, the AO initial state implementation shall not dereference or rely on this parameter. </para>
